### Add User
POST {{uri}}/api/v1/admin/user
x-access-token: Bearer {{signIn.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test-user-1@example.com",
    "mobile": "13800138001",
    "nickname": "ciallo",
    "avatar": "",
    "gender": "female",
    "region": "",
    "birthday": 0,
    "tagline": ""
}
